# Library Consortium

## Description

Distributed web application written in Go for managing a consortium of libraries.
Project for the Distributed Programming for web, IOT and mobile system.

## Technologies

- Go
- GORM
- SQLite
- Docker
- HTML Templates

## Architecture

                       Browser
                           │
                     Central Server
                           │
        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
        │                  │                  │
  Library Service    Library Service    Library Service
      Torino             Milano              Roma
        │                  │                  │
      SQLite            SQLite             SQLite

## How to run

docker compose up --build

## Services

- Central Server
- Library Service

